    sysml:owningMembership elmt:VendorFraudReview__Manifest__StopMeansNoOutput___400_om ;
    sysml:body """ WP section 5.2, verbatim: \"If a Privacy Guard detects
               sensitive information, the Op stops before external
               transmission.\" A stopped Op emits nothing — navigating the
               rules and then executing anyway is a violation.
               adjudicated: GAP-06. """ .

